# Anonymous clients on the WebSocket listener (every browser): subscribe to
# anything, publish nothing. Issue #534.
#
# Installed as /etc/mosquitto/anon-readonly.acl on orchid and on the stations,
# referenced by the `acl_file` line under `listener 9001` in squirrel.conf /
# station.conf. Topic lines before any `user` line are what anonymous clients
# get; with no write rule a publish is dropped (MQTT 3.1.1) or refused with
# "not authorized" (MQTT 5), and the subscriber side sees nothing different.
topic read #
